OL,3,GNEWSAI'm swimming with sharks to get
OL,4,Athrough cancer diagnosis
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Luke Rogers had a diagnosis of
OL,7,Fcancer for the second time before
OL,8,Fturning 38, he was crushed.
OL,10,FAfter going through his first diagnosis
OL,11,Fof melanoma while his wife was
OL,12,Fpregnant, he says the separate
OL,13,Fdiagnosis of kidney cancer came
OL,14,F"completely out of the blue".
OL,16,FThe IT manager from Perton,
OL,17,FStaffordshire, says he "couldn't curl
OL,18,Fup in a ball and let it defeat him".
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
